{"path":"experimental/shared_future","title":"std::experimental::shared_future","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>shared_future","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/shared_future","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"The class template std::experimental::shared_future extends std::shared_future with the following operations:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/shared_future&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> shared_future<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> shared_future<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-concurrency\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw1\">class</span> shared_future<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The class template <code>std::experimental::shared_future</code> extends <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future\">std::shared_future</a></span> with the following operations:\n</p>\n<ul><li> an <i>unwrapping constructor</i> from <code>future&lt;shared_future&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code>;\n</li><li> a member function <code>is_ready</code> to query whether the associated shared state is ready; and\n</li><li> a member function <code>then</code> to attach a continuation to the future.\n</li></ul>\n<p>There is no interoperation between <code>std::experimental::shared_future</code> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future\">std::shared_future</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/shared_future/shared_future\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a <code>shared_future</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/shared_future/is_ready\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>is_ready</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if the shared state is ready <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/shared_future/then\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>then</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  attaches a continuation to a <code>shared_future</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/shared_future/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns the contents <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<div id=\"identical-\" data-bg=\"e3f9df\">\n<h2 id=\"Members_identical_to_std::shared_future\">Members  identical to std::shared_future </h2>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions_2\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/~shared_future\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs the future object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::shared_future&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Getting_the_result\">Getting the result </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/get\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the result <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::shared_future&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"State\">State </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/valid\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>valid</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if the future has a shared state <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::shared_future&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/wait\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wait</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  waits for the result to become available <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::shared_future&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/wait_for\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wait_for</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  waits for the result, returns if it is not available for the specified timeout duration <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::shared_future&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/wait_until\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wait_until</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  waits for the result, returns if it is not available until specified time point has been reached <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::shared_future&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/future\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>future</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-concurrency-ts t-mark-ts\">(concurrency TS)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  a version of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future\">std::future</a></span> enhanced with continuations and other features <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":2,"text":"Members identical to std::shared_future","id":"Members_identical_to_std::shared_future"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions_2"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{